reduced to such a pathetic state?

262
00:20:49,800 --> 00:20:51,976
and shackle you to these hinterlands?

263
00:20:52,140 --> 00:20:53,557
If what I heard is true!

264
00:20:53,640 --> 00:20:56,297
And he killed the Pontifex
for the sake of the people,

265
00:20:56,380 --> 00:20:59,217
Then it is his duty to join
them at the Eastern Gate.

266
00:20:59,300 --> 00:21:00,540
and defend the land!

267
00:21:04,000 --> 00:21:05,737
Forgive me, Eldrie.

268
00:21:05,820 --> 00:21:08,717
But I cannot go with you
to assist in the battle.

269
00:21:08,800 --> 00:21:10,860
It has nothing to do with him.

270
00:21:11,360 --> 00:21:13,580
I can no longer wield my sword.

271
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:15,460
That is the reason.

272
00:21:15,820 --> 00:21:20,520
If you and I cross swords now, I
doubt I would last three strikes.

273
00:21:21,320 --> 00:21:22,500
Is that so?

274
00:21:22,960 --> 00:21:25,460
All right, I will not press you further.

275
00:21:33,200 --> 00:21:35,100
I bid you farewell, m 'lady.

276
00:21:35,400 --> 00:21:36,800
You were my mentor,

277
00:21:37,060 --> 00:21:41,040
and as long as I live, I shall
never forget all you have taught me.

278
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:42,882
Farewell, then.

279
00:21:43,420 --> 00:21:44,980
I pray you'll be safe.

280
00:22:10,880 --> 00:22:11,940
It's gotten late.

281
00:22:12,140 --> 00:22:13,197
You must be tired.

282
00:22:13,280 --> 00:22:15,104
Let's get you to bed, shall we?

283
00:22:40,600 --> 00:22:42,217
Tell me, Kirito.

284
00:22:42,300 --> 00:22:43,480
What should I do?

285
00:22:46,260 --> 00:22:47,860
What should I do?

286
00:23:04,020 --> 00:23:06,560
What is it? What's wrong?

287
00:23:25,560 --> 00:23:26,880
A fire!

288
00:23:27,160 --> 00:23:29,220
The Dark Territory is attacking!

289
00:23:31,720 --> 00:23:32,600
Sugou!

290
00:23:36,560 --> 00:23:38,060
Next time, the attack.
